{"id":"638678","name":"三麦馒头","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/638678/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"即食燕麦","amount":"100g"},{"name":"荞麦粉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"全麦粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"温水","amount":"400g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"2g"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米面","amount":"100g"},{"name":"干面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取燕麦。","img":"images/638678/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放温水拌匀。","img":"images/638678/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放酵母搅拌均匀。","img":"images/638678/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放荞麦面。","img":"images/638678/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/638678/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放玉米面。","img":"images/638678/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放全麦粉。","img":"images/638678/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉成面团。","img":"images/638678/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放温暖处发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/638678/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取出来，放干面粉揉光排气。","img":"images/638678/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搓长条。","img":"images/638678/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切馒头。","img":"images/638678/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放蒸笼里二次发酵。","img":"images/638678/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"二次发好的馒头大火烧开，中火蒸25分钟，焖5分钟即可。","img":"images/638678/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/638678/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}